{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015jQfTvsutTc2L93DRqkL6X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CKpd6Du1ASDPgm61pR3uJf","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 1 — The Dawning Archaic\n\n## Card Summary\nThe Dawning Archaic is a {10} Legendary Creature - Avatar with 7/7, Reach, and three abilities:\n1. Cost reduction: costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard\n2. Attack trigger: whenever it attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost\n3. Exile replacement: if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\n\n## Test File: `cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py`\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicProperties (10 tests)\nValidates all static card properties match the spec:\n- `test_is_creature` — Must be a Creature subclass\n- `test_name` — Name must be \"The Dawning Archaic\"\n- `test_mana_cost` — Mana cost must be {10} (generic 10)\n- `test_mana_cost_is_generic_10` — Verifies generic=10 and no colored pips\n- `test_power` — base_power must be 7\n- `test_toughness` — base_toughness must be 7\n- `test_has_reach` — Must have the Reach keyword\n- `test_is_legendary` — Must have the Legendary supertype\n- `test_has_creature_type` — Must have CardType.CREATURE\n- `test_subtype_avatar` — Must have \"Avatar\" subtype\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicCostReduction (8 tests)\nValidates the cost reduction mechanic per \"This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard\":\n- `test_no_instants_or_sorceries_no_reduction` — Empty graveyard yields 0 reduction\n- `test_one_instant_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one` — One instant = 1 reduction\n- `test_one_sorcery_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one` — One sorcery = 1 reduction\n- `test_multiple_instants_and_sorceries_reduces_by_count` — Multiple cards yield count-based reduction\n- `test_creature_in_graveyard_does_not_count` — Non-instant/sorcery cards do not contribute\n- `test_mixed_graveyard_counts_only_instants_and_sorceries` — Mixed graveyard only counts instants/sorceries\n- `test_opponent_graveyard_does_not_count` — Only your graveyard matters\n- `test_cost_reduction_cannot_exceed_generic_cost` — Handles overflow case with 12+ spells\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicAttackTrigger (4 tests)\nValidates the attack-triggered ability:\n- `test_registers_attack_trigger` — register_triggers creates an AttacksTriggeredEvent trigger\n- `test_trigger_condition_only_fires_for_self` — Trigger only fires when The Dawning Archaic attacks, not other creatures\n- `test_attack_trigger_targets_instant_in_graveyard` — Can target and cast an instant from graveyard\n- `test_attack_trigger_targets_sorcery_in_graveyard` — Can target and cast a sorcery from graveyard\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicExileReplacement (2 tests)\nValidates the exile-instead-of-graveyard replacement:\n- `test_cast_instant_from_graveyard_goes_to_exile` — Instant cast via trigger ends up in exile, not graveyard\n- `test_cast_sorcery_from_graveyard_goes_to_exile` — Sorcery cast via trigger ends up in exile, not graveyard\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicEdgeCases (4 tests)\nEdge cases and optional behavior:\n- `test_empty_graveyard_trigger_does_not_error` — No crash when no valid targets in graveyard\n- `test_creature_in_graveyard_is_not_valid_target` — Creatures in graveyard are not valid targets for the trigger\n- `test_you_may_choose_not_to_cast` — Player can decline to cast (\"you may\" is optional)\n- `test_cast_without_paying_mana_cost` — No mana needed to cast via the trigger\n\n## Edge Cases NOT Covered (and why)\n- **Countered spell exile behavior**: Whether a countered spell still goes to exile instead of graveyard. The \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard\" clause implies yes, but this would require stack-based counter testing which is complex and beyond the direct card contract.\n- **Multiple attack triggers in same combat**: The card is legendary so only one copy can exist.\n- **Flashback/other graveyard interactions**: Out of scope for this card's tests.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":127,"cache_read_input_tokens":65347,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":127,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":44,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014Pw2oHgD6yUKfYZWEFp2ZP","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"4e2fa55e-e64d-47ff-a596-38c21b2f5b33","request_id":"req_011CbUqHBB4LngCTY2mdkPCd","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_1"}
