os_1/impl-rationale.md explaining your implementation approach.\n- Write a file list to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-files.txt listing all files you modified (one per line).\n- Update FILES_MODIFIED.json at the repo root — upsert an entry for card sos_1 with shape: {\"card\": \"sos_1\", \"tests\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}], \"implementation\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}]}\n\n## Return format\nReturn a short status summary:\n```\nIMPL_DONE (or DISPUTE)\nfiles_changed: N\ntests_passing: all (or list failing)\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: one-line summary\n```\n\nIf a test is genuinely wrong (tests something impossible in the engine), return DISPUTE with disputed_tests list and write /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-dispute.md explaining why."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EtHMBTqbcJGhJSFRoWaLBg","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"02a99338-ac47-4b92-9c58-3f94878c11ba","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:47:39.901Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_1"}
