{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018adWrwChpGVu3XBxHxuNTj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XkPwq9oNwASMTTSqaUPTpU","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","content":"# Key Decisions\n\nPersistent decision log across all runs.\n\n## sos_1: Exile replacement via marker flag\n- For cards that exile spells cast from graveyard (\"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"), a `_<source>_exile` marker attribute on the card is checked in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell()`.\n- This avoids deeper engine restructuring (the ReplacementManager handles battlefield-leaving replacements, not stack-to-graveyard).\n\n## sos_1: Cost reduction pattern\n- `cost_reduction(game)` returns the raw count (unclamped). The engine's `get_cost_reduction()` handles clamping at generic cost.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":112,"cache_read_input_tokens":21430,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":112},"output_tokens":59,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"cfccc643-24ef-4213-9384-aa9cd9dde99c","request_id":"req_011CbUqo3z47fw5RMNKxKNh9"}
