{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01V9EM9nLsMzCmMQFsMpuuN5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RPR34HDJ91mNjDeiWcmZz2","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_4 (Together as One)\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n- **Sorcery subclass**: Extended `Sorcery` base class which automatically adds `CardType.SORCERY` to `card_types`.\n- **`colors_spent` attribute**: Initialized as an empty list in `__init__`. Tests set this directly (e.g. `card.colors_spent = [Color.WHITE, Color.BLUE]`). X is computed as `len(set(colors_spent))` to count distinct colors.\n- **Targeting**: Returns two `TargetRequirement` objects:\n  1. First targets a player (filter checks for `life` attribute without `card_types`).\n  2. Second targets \"any target\" (player or creature — checks for `life` or `CardType.CREATURE`).\n- **Resolution**: Uses `chosen_targets[0]` for card draw target and `chosen_targets[1]` for damage target. Controller gains life regardless of targets.\n- **Engine helpers used**: `engine.game.draw_card` for card draw, `engine.game.deal_damage` for damage, direct `controller.life += x` for life gain (no dedicated engine helper exists for life gain).\n- **Edge case handling**: Returns early when X=0 or when `chosen_targets` is missing/insufficient, preventing crashes.\n\n## No Engine Modifications\n\nThis card was implemented entirely within `card_impl.py` using existing engine APIs. No engine changes were needed.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Converge cards can use a `colors_spent` list attribute on the card object, with X = number of distinct colors in the list. This is set by the casting system or directly by tests.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":106,"cache_read_input_tokens":46178,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_in