{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XJPo2y3Nk4qrZSVzBCj3en","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Key Decisions\n2\t\n3\tPersistent decision log across all runs.\n4\t\n5\t## sos_1: Exile replacement via marker flag\n6\t- For cards that exile spells cast from graveyard (\"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"), a `_<source>_exile` marker attribute on the card is checked in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell()`.\n7\t- This avoids deeper engine restructuring (the ReplacementManager handles battlefield-leaving replacements, not stack-to-graveyard).\n8\t\n9\t## sos_1: Cost reduction pattern\n10\t- `cost_reduction(game)` returns the raw count (unclamped). The engine's `get_cost_reduction()` handles clamping at generic cost.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"53e221f0-eb04-4a99-ba58-12aa5c66bf50","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:02:10.366Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","content":"# Key Decisions\n\nPersistent decision log across all runs.\n\n## sos_1: Exile replacement via marker flag\n- For cards that exile spells cast from graveyard (\"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"), a `_<source>_exile` marker attribute on the card is checked in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell()`.\n- This avoids deeper engine restructuring (the ReplacementManager handles battlefield-leaving replacements, not stack-to-graveyard).\n\n## sos_1: Cost reduction pattern\n- `cost_reduction(game)` returns the raw count (unclamped). The engine's `get_cost_reduction()` handles clamping at generic cost.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
