{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RYxfrLCJcM3rpkKpysJjA2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"card_id\": \"sos_13\",\n4\t    \"requirement\": \"While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.\",\n5\t    \"why_untestable\": \"The engine has no existing 'prepared' designation infrastructure (no is_prepared attribute, no prepare-spell copy creation mechanism, no exile-cast-copy flow). The full prepared mechanic involves creating a copy of the prepare spell in exile (per rule 722.3c), allowing the controller to cast that copy, and unpreparation upon casting. Testing the full cast-from-prepared flow requires engine extensions that do not yet exist.\",\n6\t    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"The Implementer needs to: (1) add is_prepared/prepared attribute to creatures, (2) implement the exile-copy creation when a permanent becomes prepared, (3) implement the casting-from-exile and unprepare mechanics. Once these are built, tests can verify the full prepared lifecycle.\"\n7\t  },\n8\t  {\n9\t    \"card_id\": \"sos_13\",\n10\t    \"requirement\": \"Swords to Plowshares prepare spell effect (Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.)\",\n11\t    \"why_untestable\": \"The card_spec.json oracle_text only includes the front face text. The prepare spell's effect (Swords to Plowshares: exile target creature, controller gains life equal to power) is implied by the card name but not explicitly stated in the spec. Additionally, the engine lacks prepared-spell casting infrastructure to test this spell's resolution.\",\n12\t    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"The card spec should include the prepare spell's oracle text explicitly. The Implementer needs to implement the Swords to Plowshares effect and the prepared casting infrastructure. Then tests can verify exile + life gain.\"\n13\t  }\n14\t]\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"a81a5dfe-5f43-420d-ab48-36f285e02c54","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:06:49.056Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"card_id\": \"sos_13\",\n    \"requirement\": \"While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.\",\n    \"why_untestable\": \"The engine has no existing 'prepared' designation infrastructure (no is_prepared attribute, no prepare-spell copy creation mechanism, no exile-cast-copy flow). The full prepared mechanic involves creating a copy of the prepare spell in exile (per rule 722.3c), allowing the controller to cast that copy, and unpreparation upon casting. Testing the full cast-from-prepared flow requires engine extensions that do not yet exist.\",\n    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"The Implementer needs to: (1) add is_prepared/prepared attribute to creatures, (2) implement the exile-copy creation when a permanent becomes prepared, (3) implement the casting-from-exile and unprepare mechanics. Once these are built, tests can verify the full prepared lifecycle.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"card_id\": \"sos_13\",\n    \"requirement\": \"Swords to Plowshares prepare spell effect (Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.)\",\n    \"why_untestable\": \"The card_spec.json oracle_text only includes the front face text. The prepare spell's effect (Swords to Plowshares: exile target creature, controller gains life equal to power) is implied by the card name but not explicitly stated in the spec. Additionally, the engine lacks prepared-spell casting infrastructure to test this spell's resolution.\",\n    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"The card spec should include the prepare spell's oracle text explicitly. The Implementer needs to implement the Swords to Plowshares effect and the prepared casting infrastructure. Then tests can verify exile + life gain.\"\n  }\n]\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
