{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lb2oaL47SWFHMs7dYQ3C8q","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Rationale for SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n2\t\n3\t## File: cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\n4\t\n5\t### TestEmeritusStaticProperties (7 tests)\n6\tValidates the card's static characteristics match the spec:\n7\t- `test_is_creature` — Verifies the card is an instance of Creature.\n8\t- `test_name` — Card name matches \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\".\n9\t- `test_mana_cost` — Front face mana cost is {1}{W}{W}.\n10\t- `test_power` — Base power is 3.\n11\t- `test_toughness` — Base toughness is 3.\n12\t- `test_subtypes_include_cat_and_cleric` — Subtypes include Cat and Cleric.\n13\t- `test_has_creature_card_type` — Card types include CREATURE.\n14\t\n15\t### TestEmeritusETBTriggerRegistration (3 tests)\n16\tValidates the trigger registration for the enters-the-battlefield ability:\n17\t- `test_registers_at_least_one_trigger` — register_triggers adds at least one trigger to the trigger_manager.\n18\t- `test_registered_trigger_watches_etb_event` — The trigger watches EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent.\n19\t- `test_trigger_condition_fires_only_for_self` — The condition fires only when this card itself enters, not other creatures.\n20\t\n21\t### TestEmeritusInklingTokenCreation (7 tests)\n22\tValidates the Inkling token creation on ETB:\n23\t- `test_controller_gets_inkling_when_self_is_target` — When the controller targets themselves, a token appears on their battlefield.\n24\t- `test_opponent_gets_inkling_when_opponent_is_target` — When the opponent is targeted, the token appears on the opponent's battlefield.\n25\t- `test_inkling_token_is_creature` — Token is a Creature instance.\n26\t- `test_inkling_token_is_one_one` — Token has base power 1 and base toughness 1.\n27\t- `test_inkling_token_has_flying` — Token has the Flying keyword.\n28\t- `test_inkling_token_has_inkling_subtype` — Token has \"Inkling\" in its subtypes.\n29\t- `test_inkling_token_name` — Token is named \"Inkling\".\n30\t\n31\t### TestEmeritusPreparedCondition (4 tests)\n32\tValidates the prepared designation logic after token creation:\n33\t- `test_becomes_prepared_when_opponent_has_more_creatures` — Card becomes prepared when opponent controls strictly more creatures.\n34\t- `test_not_prepared_when_controller_has_equal_or_more_creatures` — Card does NOT become prepared when controller has equal or more creatures.\n35\t- `test_not_prepared_when_opponent_has_fewer_creatures` — Edge case: opponent has fewer creatures.\n36\t- `test_prepared_accounts_for_inkling_given_to_opponent` — When the Inkling goes to the opponent, the creature count comparison reflects the token being on the opponent's side.\n37\t\n38\t### TestEmeritusPreparedDesignation (1 test)\n39\t- `test_starts_not_prepared` — Card should start without the prepared designation.\n40\t\n41\t### TestEmeritusTargeting (1 test)\n42\t- `test_etb_target_is_player` — The ETB ability targets any player, verified through get_targets or chosen_targets.\n43\t\n44\t### TestEmeritusCastAndResolve (1 test)\n45\t- `test_cast_creates_inkling_token` — End-to-end test using cast_spell to cast the creature and verify both the card arrives on battlefield and an Inkling token is created.\n46\t\n47\t### Edge cases covered\n48\t- Token given to controller vs opponent (creature count diverges).\n49\t- Creature count comparison after token placement (the \"then if\" clause checks AFTER creation).\n50\t- Equal creature counts (should NOT trigger prepared).\n51\t- Opponent with fewer creatures (should NOT trigger prepared).\n52\t\n53\t### Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n54\t- **Swords to Plowshares spell effect**: The prepare spell (exile target creature, controller gains life equal to its power) is a complex mechanic involving creating a copy in exile, casting the copy, and unpreparation. The engine has no existing \"prepared\" infrastructure. The basic prepared designation tracking and condition checking ARE tested, but the full cast-copy-from-exile flow would require engine extensions that are the Implementer's responsibility. Documented in untestable.json.\n55\t- **Multiple opponents**: Engine only supports 2 players.\n56\t- **Protection from white/black preventing token creation**: Out of scope for this card.\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"c570f81e-7841-49e0-b71f-5e62ff991f40","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:06:51.390Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\n\n### TestEmeritusStaticProperties (7 tests)\nValidates the card's static characteristics match the spec:\n- `test_is_creature` — Verifies the card is an instance of Creature.\n- `test_name` — Card name matches \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\".\n- `test_mana_cost` — Front face mana cost is {1}{W}{W}.\n- `test_power` — Base power is 3.\n- `test_toughness` — Base toughness is 3.\n- `test_subtypes_include_cat_and_cleric` — Subtypes include Cat and Cleric.\n- `test_has_creature_card_type` — Card types include CREATURE.\n\n### TestEmeritusETBTriggerRegistration (3 tests)\nValidates the trigger registration for the enters-the-battlefield ability:\n- `test_registers_at_least_one_trigger` — register_triggers adds at least one trigger to the trigger_manager.\n- `test_registered_trigger_watches_etb_event` — The trigger watches EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent.\n- `test_trigger_condition_fires_only_for_self` — The condition fires only when this card itself enters, not other creatures.\n\n### TestEmeritusInklingTokenCreation (7 tests)\nValidates the Inkling token creation on ETB:\n- `test_controller_gets_inkling_when_self_is_target` — When the controller targets themselves, a token appears on their battlefield.\n- `test_opponent_gets_inkling_when_opponent_is_target` — When the opponent is targeted, the token appears on the opponent's battlefield.\n- `test_inkling_token_is_creature` — Token is a Creature instance.\n- `test_inkling_token_is_one_one` — Token has base power 1 and base toughness 1.\n- `test_inkling_token_has_flying` — Token has the Flying keyword.\n- `test_inkling_token_has_inkling_subtype` — Token has \"Inkling\" in its subtypes.\n- `test_inkling_token_name` — Token is named \"Inkling\".\n\n### TestEmeritusPreparedCondition (4 tests)\nValidates the prepared designation logic after token creation:\n- `test_becomes_prepared_when_opponent_has_more_creatures` — Card becomes prepared when opponent controls strictly more creatures.\n- `test_not_prepared_when_controller_has_equal_or_more_creatures` — Card does NOT become prepared when controller has equal or more creatures.\n- `test_not_prepared_when_opponent_has_fewer_creatures` — Edge case: opponent has fewer creatures.\n- `test_prepared_accounts_for_inkling_given_to_opponent` — When the Inkling goes to the opponent, the creature count comparison reflects the token being on the opponent's side.\n\n### TestEmeritusPreparedDesignation (1 test)\n- `test_starts_not_prepared` — Card should start without the prepared designation.\n\n### TestEmeritusTargeting (1 test)\n- `test_etb_target_is_player` — The ETB ability targets any player, verified through get_targets or chosen_targets.\n\n### TestEmeritusCastAndResolve (1 test)\n- `test_cast_creates_inkling_token` — End-to-end test using cast_spell to cast the creature and verify both the card arrives on battlefield and an Inkling token is created.\n\n### Edge cases covered\n- Token given to controller vs opponent (creature count diverges).\n- Creature count comparison after token placement (the \"then if\" clause checks AFTER creation).\n- Equal creature counts (should NOT trigger prepared).\n- Opponent with fewer creatures (should NOT trigger prepared).\n\n### Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n- **Swords to Plowshares spell effect**: The prepare spell (exile target creature, controller gains life equal to its power) is a complex mechanic involving creating a copy in exile, casting the copy, and unpreparation. The engine has no existing \"prepared\" infrastructure. The basic prepared designation tracking and condition checking ARE tested, but the full cast-copy-from-exile flow would require engine extensions that are the Implementer's responsibility. Documented in untestable.json.\n- **Multiple opponents**: Engine only supports 2 players.\n- **Protection from white/black preventing token creation**: Out of scope for this card.\n","numLines":57,"startLine":1,"totalLines":57}}}
