{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RvKAa4jhPVTMH1Pmv6Q2Zh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_13\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable Requirements — Implementer Responsibilities\n4\t\n5\tThe Tester flagged two requirements as untestable due to missing engine infrastructure. The Implementer must:\n6\t\n7\t1. **Implement the \"prepared\" designation mechanic** in the engine or card implementation:\n8\t   - Add `is_prepared` / prepared state tracking to creatures\n9\t   - When a permanent becomes prepared, create a copy of its prepare spell in exile (per MTG rule 722.3c)\n10\t   - Allow casting the copy from exile\n11\t   - Unprepare the permanent when the copy is cast\n12\t\n13\t2. **Implement the Swords to Plowshares prepare spell effect**:\n14\t   - Exile target creature\n15\t   - Its controller gains life equal to its power\n16\t   - This is the prepare spell attached to Emeritus of Truce\n17\t\n18\tAfter implementation, the Tester will be re-invoked to add tests for the prepared casting flow.\n19\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01H6edwdD9h9cdEHviTEV25h","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"16e3b76e-51e3-4377-8806-8d6912a5be88","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:07:22.439Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_13"}
