{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018u1NwzivTe3uMxZ8GiwYx3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AsqNJYrhcRQYK7dk5ozNEn","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_13 — Swords to Plowshares Prepare Spell\n\n## Changes\n\nAdded `resolve_prepare_spell(game, target)` method to `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares`.\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n- Used the existing `move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone)` function from `engine/zones.py` to handle the exile transition. This properly handles battlefield-leaving hooks (trigger firing, trigger/replacement unregistration).\n- Record the creature's `base_power` and `controller` before the zone move, since zone transitions may clear transient state.\n- Life gain is only applied when power > 0, matching the zero-power edge case test.\n- Sets `self.is_prepared = False` after resolving the spell effect, implementing the \"doing so unprepares it\" reminder text.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- The `resolve_prepare_spell(game, target)` method pattern can be reused for other preparation cards that have a prepare spell effect.\n- The method records creature stats before the zone move to ensure consistency.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":97,"cache_read_input_tokens":34974,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":97,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":36,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G5PjHgHnPkrLeY7jb5LTQd","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"64ae9035-779f-4c9f-b695-c0ee694582bc","request_id":"req_011CbUsdyXeNRqeq15uWWaw5","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_13 prepare spell"}
