{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XaxsYQyfxGHX9FWddbEXdT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation Rationale: sos_13 — Swords to Plowshares Prepare Spell\n2\t\n3\t## Changes\n4\t\n5\tAdded `resolve_prepare_spell(game, target)` method to `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares`.\n6\t\n7\t## Design Decisions\n8\t\n9\t- Used the existing `move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone)` function from `engine/zones.py` to handle the exile transition. This properly handles battlefield-leaving hooks (trigger firing, trigger/replacement unregistration).\n10\t- Record the creature's `base_power` and `controller` before the zone move, since zone transitions may clear transient state.\n11\t- Life gain is only applied when power > 0, matching the zero-power edge case test.\n12\t- Sets `self.is_prepared = False` after resolving the spell effect, implementing the \"doing so unprepares it\" reminder text.\n13\t\n14\t## Conventions\n15\t\n16\t- The `resolve_prepare_spell(game, target)` method pattern can be reused for other preparation cards that have a prepare spell effect.\n17\t- The method records creature stats before the zone move to ensure consistency.\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"06d4938c-7663-4618-8279-8198b15a7bec","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:20:28.777Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_13 — Swords to Plowshares Prepare Spell\n\n## Changes\n\nAdded `resolve_prepare_spell(game, target)` method to `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares`.\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n- Used the existing `move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone)` function from `engine/zones.py` to handle the exile transition. This properly handles battlefield-leaving hooks (trigger firing, trigger/replacement unregistration).\n- Record the creature's `base_power` and `controller` before the zone move, since zone transitions may clear transient state.\n- Life gain is only applied when power > 0, matching the zero-power edge case test.\n- Sets `self.is_prepared = False` after resolving the spell effect, implementing the \"doing so unprepares it\" reminder text.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- The `resolve_prepare_spell(game, target)` method pattern can be reused for other preparation cards that have a prepare spell effect.\n- The method records creature stats before the zone move to ensure consistency.\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}}}
