{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RPYRAbafgwqLgNkb2GqUPt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PXYvqRpVqkbg92nT7EVdcf","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale: SOS 57 — Mana Sculpt\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py\n\n### TestManaSculptProperties (4 tests)\nValidates static card data matches the card spec:\n- **test_is_instant**: Mana Sculpt must be an Instant subclass.\n- **test_name**: Name must be \"Mana Sculpt\".\n- **test_mana_cost**: Mana cost must parse to {1}{U}{U}.\n- **test_card_type_includes_instant**: card_types must include CardType.INSTANT.\n\n### TestManaSculptTargeting (4 tests)\nValidates the targeting mechanism:\n- **test_returns_target_requirement_when_spell_on_stack**: get_targets() should return a TargetRequirement when there's a spell on the stack.\n- **test_target_zone_is_stack**: The target requirement's zone should be Zone.STACK.\n- **test_cannot_cast_with_empty_stack**: can_cast() should return False when the stack is empty (nothing to counter).\n- **test_can_cast_with_spell_on_stack**: can_cast() should return True when there's a spell on the stack.\n\n### TestManaSculptCounterEffect (3 tests)\nValidates the core counter effect:\n- **test_countered_spell_goes_to_graveyard**: The countered spell's card ends up in its owner's graveyard.\n- **test_countered_spell_removed_from_stack**: The StackObject is removed from the game stack.\n- **test_no_target_is_a_noop**: If chosen_targets is empty/unset, on_resolve should not raise.\n\n### TestManaSculptWizardCheck (2 tests)\nValidates the Wizard condition:\n- **test_no_wizard_no_mana_added**: Without a Wizard on the battlefield, no mana is added even after advancing to the next main phase.\n- **test_with_wizard_triggers_mana_production**: With a Wizard controlled, resolution should set up a delayed trigger or mechanism for mana production.\n\n### TestManaSculptDelayedMana (3 tests)\nValidates the delayed mana production:\n- **test_mana_amount_equals_countered_spell_cmc**: Countering a CMC-5 spell should produce 5 colorless mana at the next main phase.\n- **test_mana_amount_for_cheap_spell**: Countering a CMC-1 spell should produce 1 colorless mana.\n- **test_mana_is_colorless**: Only colorless mana (ManaType.COLORLESS) should be added, not any colored mana.\n\n### TestManaSculptEdgeCases (4 tests)\nEdge cases and interactions:\n- **test_wizard_leaves_before_resolve_no_mana**: If the Wizard leaves the battlefield before Mana Sculpt resolves, no delayed trigger is created (Wizard check happens at resolution time).\n- **test_spell_still_countered_even_without_wizard**: The counter effect is unconditional — the Wizard condition only gates the mana bonus.\n- **test_counter_creature_spell**: Mana Sculpt targets \"target spell\" (any spell), including creature spells.\n- **test_zero_cost_spell_yields_zero_mana**: A zero-cost spell produces zero colorless mana (edge case for the amount calculation).\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n\n- **X-cost spells**: The oracle text says \"mana spent to cast that spell\". For X-cost spells, the actual mana spent differs from CMC. This is an ambiguity in how the engine tracks \"mana spent\" vs \"mana value\". The engine currently records `colors_spent` but not a total mana spent amount. This is noted in untestable.json.\n- **Multiple Wizards**: Having multiple Wizards should not double the mana — the condition is \"if you control a Wizard\" (binary check). This is implicitly covered by the existing tests.\n- **Delayed trigger timing with \"your next main phase\"**: The exact timing semantics (precombat vs postcombat, whose turn) are tested implicitly via the main phase advancement.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":367,"cache_read_input_tokens":79290,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":367,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TAUth1vzYjstFkMSuV9Fdg","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"601b121b-d860-4e40-9216-fc50cb3e64f6","request_id":"req_011CbUt76dHY9KNG4oZi3dBJ","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_57"}
