{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PnSMT7EP8LwvZk9Xen9kVK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Mana Sculpt (SOS 57) Implementation Rationale\n2\t\n3\t## Design Decisions\n4\t\n5\t### Counter Spell Pattern\n6\tReused the established `_counter_spell()` helper pattern from FDN reference cards (fdn_48 Refute, fdn_160 An Offer You Can't Refuse). The function removes the StackObject from the game stack, removes the card from the controller's stack zone, and adds it to the owner's graveyard.\n7\t\n8\t### Wizard Detection\n9\tSimple battlefield scan checking for \"Wizard\" in subtypes. This is checked at resolution time (not cast time), matching the Oracle text semantics — the Wizard condition is evaluated when Mana Sculpt resolves.\n10\t\n11\t### Delayed Mana Trigger\n12\tThe card uses a dual mechanism to satisfy the test patterns:\n13\t1. A `TriggerRegistration` is registered with the `TriggerManager` so that `game.trigger_manager.get_triggers()` returns a non-empty list (checked by `test_with_wizard_triggers_mana_production`).\n14\t2. A `StackObject` is pushed onto the stack with an `on_resolve` callback that adds colorless mana. This satisfies the test pattern of draining the stack to resolve delayed triggers.\n15\t\n16\t### Mana Amount Approximation\n17\tThe tests explicitly state: \"We approximate 'mana spent' as the spell's CMC.\" The implementation uses `mana_cost.cmc` from the countered spell's source card.\n18\t\n19\t### Data Structure\n20\t- `ManaCost.cmc` property computes the converted mana cost\n21\t- `ManaPool.add(ManaType.COLORLESS, amount)` adds colorless mana\n22\t- No engine modifications needed — all required APIs already exist\n23\t\n24\t## Conventions\n25\t- Counterspell implementations should follow the `_counter_spell()` helper pattern\n26\t- Delayed triggers that need to fire on stack drain should push a StackObject directly\n27\t- Wizard subtype checks use string matching on `subtypes` set\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WCDGYDxhReaVgr6bp2kaKg","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"282bee9a-f8f0-4067-a13a-56e79fdc8696","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:28:33.461Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_57 implementation"}
