{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CFVEaPR9TWhqHp3c8QBkd1","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 20 tests pass.\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\nfiles_changed: 2\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-revised.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-revised-rationale.md\nnotes: Fixed TriggerRegistration by adding _main_phase_condition that checks active player is controller and phase is PRECOMBAT_MAIN or POSTCOMBAT_MAIN, preventing double-counting from unrelated TriggeredEvents. Removed dead `if cmc <= 0: pass` block."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: add5f921bc68761e7 (use SendMessage with to: 'add5f921bc68761e7' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 38203\ntool_uses: 22\nduration_ms: 132013</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"e38fdd6a-df14-4457-8fd0-0ffcf92d5a68","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:32:26.356Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"You are the Implementer agent. Revise the sos_57 implementation based on reviewer feedback.\n\n## Card\n- Card ID: sos_57\n- Implementation: cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\n- Tests: cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py (DO NOT MODIFY)\n- Current diff: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff\n- Review: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/review.json\n\n## Strict issue to fix\nThe reviewer found that the TriggerRegistration uses `event_type=TriggeredEvent` with `condition=None`, which would fire on ANY TriggeredEvent in the game. Combined with the StackObject also being pushed, this creates a double-counting risk. Fix by either:\n(a) Adding a proper condition that checks for the correct phase/player, or  \n(b) Removing the TriggerRegistration entirely if the StackObject alone satisfies the requirements\n\nAdvisory items (may ignore):\n- Dead code `if cmc <= 0: pass` block\n- filter_fn comparing against self (harmless, matches FDN pattern)\n\n## Instructions\n1. Read the review.json for full context.\n2. Fix the strict issue.\n3. Do NOT modify test files.\n4. Verify: `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py -x -v`\n5. Verify no regressions: `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -x -q && python3 -m pytest cards/fdn/ -x -q`\n\n## Output\n- Write revised diff: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-revised.diff\n- Write rationale: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-revised-rationale.md\n- Write disagreements: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/disagreements.json (array, empty [] if none)\n- Update FILES_MODIFIED.json\n\nReturn: REVISION_DONE with disagreement_count.","agentId":"add5f921bc68761e7","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 20 tests pass.\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\nfiles_changed: 2\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-revised.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-revised-rationale.md\nnotes: Fixed TriggerRegistration by adding _main_phase_condition that checks active player is controller and phase is PRECOMBAT_MAIN or POSTCOMBAT_MAIN, preventing double-counting from unrelated TriggeredEvents. Removed dead `if cmc <= 0: pass` block."}],"totalDurationMs":132013,"totalTokens":38203,"totalToolUseCount":22,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":212,"cache_read_input_tokens":37835,"output_tokens":155,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":212},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":155,"cache_read_input_tokens":37835,"cache_creation_input_tokens":212,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":212,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":8,"searchCount":1,"bashCount":10,"editFileCount":3,"linesAdded":54,"linesRemoved":25,"otherToolCount":0}}}
