{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QTowZHum1HATv6SjVPM9Bs","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/types.py:164:    def cmc(self) -> int:\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:11:| `types.py` | 250+ | **Foundation** — All enums (`Color`, `ManaType`, `Zone`, `Phase`, `Step`, `CardType`, `Supertype`, `Keyword`) and core dataclasses (`ManaCost` with `.parse()` and `.cmc`, `HybridManaSymbol`, `TargetRequirement` with lazy `filter_fn` convention). `ManaCost.parse()` handles `{X/Y}` hybrid mana tokens. Zero internal dependencies. |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YTug4FjT75hgzoXKoKn9cv","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"b72cfe5f-d94e-4870-b2c8-bf8f12932440","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:33:52.748Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_97"}
