{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JLPCs9AeLhz5N8qYqoWMqr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013tLvE6VnoRJtQj1SHViFhp","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 97 -- Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\n\n### TestRalZarekProperties (7 tests)\nValidates all static card data against the card spec:\n- **test_is_planeswalker**: Card must be a Planeswalker subclass.\n- **test_name**: Exact name match \"Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\".\n- **test_mana_cost**: Must parse to {1}{B}{B}.\n- **test_starting_loyalty**: Starting loyalty must be 3.\n- **test_is_legendary**: Must have Supertype.LEGENDARY.\n- **test_has_planeswalker_type**: Must have CardType.PLANESWALKER.\n- **test_subtype_ral**: Must have \"Ral\" in subtypes.\n\n### TestRalZarekLoyaltyAbilities (6 tests)\nValidates the structure of get_loyalty_abilities():\n- **test_returns_four_abilities**: Must return exactly 4 abilities (+1, -1, -2, -7).\n- **test_all_are_loyalty_abilities**: Each must be a LoyaltyAbility instance.\n- **test_first_ability_is_plus_one**: Loyalty cost +1.\n- **test_second_ability_is_minus_one**: Loyalty cost -1.\n- **test_third_ability_is_minus_two**: Loyalty cost -2.\n- **test_fourth_ability_is_minus_seven**: Loyalty cost -7.\n\n### TestRalZarekSurveil (2 tests)\nTests the +1 ability (Surveil 2):\n- **test_surveil_puts_cards_in_graveyard**: With a library of 3 cards, surveil 2 should look at top 2 and allow putting them into the graveyard.\n- **test_surveil_with_fewer_cards_than_surveil_count**: Edge case -- surveil with only 1 card in library should not error.\n\n### TestRalZarekDiscard (4 tests)\nTests the -1 ability (Any number of target players each discard a card):\n- **test_opponent_discards_a_card**: Targeting the opponent forces them to discard.\n- **test_both_players_discard**: Targeting both players forces each to discard.\n- **test_targeting_zero_players_is_allowed**: Empty target list is a no-op.\n- **test_player_with_empty_hand_no_error**: Targeting a player with empty hand should not error.\n\n### TestRalZarekReanimate (5 tests)\nTests the -2 ability (Return creature with MV <= 3 from graveyard to battlefield):\n- **test_returns_creature_to_battlefield**: A valid creature moves from GY to battlefield.\n- **test_creature_with_mv_3_is_valid**: Boundary -- MV exactly 3 is legal.\n- **test_creature_with_mv_0_is_valid**: MV 0 creature is legal.\n- **test_no_target_is_noop**: No target should not raise.\n- **test_graveyard_targeting_filter**: The targeting filter should accept MV<=3 creatures and reject MV>3.\n\n### TestRalZarekUltimate (3 tests)\nTests the -7 ability (Flip five coins, opponent skips X turns):\n- **test_all_heads_skips_five_turns**: All heads = skip 5 turns.\n- **test_all_tails_skips_zero_turns**: All tails = skip 0 turns.\n- **test_no_target_is_noop**: No target should not crash.\n\n## Edge cases covered\n- Empty hand discard (no-op).\n- Zero targets for -1 ability.\n- MV boundary (exactly 3, exactly 0) for -2 ability.\n- Library smaller than surveil count.\n- All-heads and all-tails extremes for coin flips.\n- Missing targets for all abilities.\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (out of scope)\n- Planeswalker uniqueness rule (engine-level).\n- Damage redirection to planeswalker (engine-level).\n- Loyalty ability activation timing (once per turn, sorcery speed) -- engine-level.\n- Detailed surveil ordering of cards back on top -- the surveil implementation details depend heavily on how the implementer structures player choices, making exact assertion fragile.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6064,"cache_read_input_tokens":55498,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6064,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YTug4FjT75hgzoXKoKn9cv","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"291a8953-80c9-4897-ba85-48dbba0ed91e","request_id":"req_011CbUu1Xc9b8ZmtrTzesJBL","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_97"}
