{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ya48FmfR6aT6qrdgCVJt8s","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/abilities.py:68:class LoyaltyAbilityInstance:\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-69-    \"\"\"Runtime representation of a planeswalker loyalty ability.\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-70-\nengine/abilities.py-71-    Loyalty abilities are activated abilities with special restrictions:\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-72-    they may only be activated at sorcery speed, and only once per turn\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-73-    per source (tracked via ``_activated_this_turn``).\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-74-\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-75-    The cost adjusts the loyalty counters on the source planeswalker.\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-76-\nengine/abilities.py-77-    Attributes:\nengine/abilities.py-78-        source: The planeswalker permanent.\nengine/abilities.py-79-        controller: The player who controls the planeswalker.\nengine/abilities.py-80-        loyalty_cost: The loyalty adjustment (positive for ``+N``,\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-81-            negative for ``−N``, zero for ``0``).\nengine/abilities.py-82-        effect: A callable ``(game) -> None`` for the ability's effect.\nengine/abilities.py-83-        description: Human-readable description.\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-84-    \"\"\"\n/workspace/engine/abilities.py-85-\nengine/abilities.py-86-    source: Any\nengine/abilities.py-87-    controller: Any  # Player\nengine/abilities.py-88-    loyalty_cost: int = 0\n--\nengine/card.py:60:class LoyaltyAbility:\n/workspace/engine/card.py-61-    \"\"\"A planeswalker loyalty ability.\n/workspace/engine/card.py-62-\nengine/card.py-63-    Attributes:\nengine/card.py-64-        loyalty_cost: The loyalty cost (positive for ``+``, negative for ``−``).\nengine/card.py-65-        effect: A callable that applies the ability's effect.\nengine/card.py-66-        description: Human-readable description.\n/workspace/engine/card.py-67-    \"\"\"\n/workspace/engine/card.py-68-\nengine/card.py-69-    loyalty_cost: int\nengine/card.py-70-    effect: Callable[..., Any]\nengine/card.py-71-    description: str = \"\"\n/workspace/engine/card.py-72-\n/workspace/engine/card.py-73-\n/workspace/engine/card.py-74-@dataclass\nengine/card.py-75-class ManaAbility:\n/workspace/engine/card.py-76-    \"\"\"A mana ability (does not use the stack).\n/workspace/engine/card.py-77-\nengine/card.py-78-    Attributes:\nengine/card.py-79-        cost: A callable that checks/pays the cost.\nengine/card.py-80-        mana_produced: A callable that returns the mana added."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FDMEtpQ3ZvLTtxxDBywmQp","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"52b2abed-22c6-4779-8781-80fe17a51fc6","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:41:04.109Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_97 implementation"}
