{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01HAmDhcX3n6uqhrqDpzThVE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EBrHvPEgWFwYMjQ21zL9AK","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 120 — Improvisation Capstone\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py\n\n### TestImprovisationCapstoneProperties (4 tests)\nStatic property tests validating the card's identity matches the spec.\n\n- **test_is_sorcery**: Card must be a Sorcery (type line says \"Sorcery — Lesson\").\n- **test_name**: Card name must be \"Improvisation Capstone\".\n- **test_mana_cost**: Mana cost must be {5}{R}{R}.\n- **test_subtypes_include_lesson**: Subtypes must include \"Lesson\" (from type line \"Sorcery — Lesson\").\n\n### TestImprovisationCapstoneExileEffect (6 tests)\nTests the primary effect: \"Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile cards with total mana value 4 or greater.\"\n\n- **test_exiles_cards_until_total_mv_reaches_four**: Four 1-MV cards on top; all four must be exiled to reach total MV 4.\n- **test_stops_exiling_once_mv_threshold_met**: A single 4-MV card on top should stop after one card.\n- **test_mv_five_exceeds_threshold_stops**: A single 5-MV card exceeds threshold; only one card exiled.\n- **test_zero_mv_cards_do_not_count_toward_threshold**: MV-0 cards are exiled but don't count toward the threshold.\n- **test_empty_library_does_not_crash**: Edge case — empty library should not cause an error. Also verifies Paradigm trigger still registers.\n- **test_library_exhausted_before_threshold**: If the library runs out before reaching MV 4, exile what's available without crashing.\n\n### TestImprovisationCapstoneCasting (4 tests)\nTests the free-cast effect: \"You may cast any number of spells from among them without paying their mana costs.\"\n\n- **test_cast_exiled_spell_without_paying_mana**: Choosing to cast a creature puts it on the battlefield without mana payment.\n- **test_choose_not_to_cast_leaves_in_exile**: Declining to cast keeps the card in exile.\n- **test_can_cast_multiple_spells_from_exiled**: Verifies \"any number\" — two exiled spells can both be cast.\n- **test_lands_among_exiled_cannot_be_cast**: Lands are not spells and cannot be cast from among the exiled cards.\n\n### TestImprovisationCapstoneParadigm (3 tests)\nTests the Paradigm keyword ability.\n\n- **test_spell_is_exiled_after_resolution**: Paradigm says \"Exile this spell\" — the spell should end up in exile, not the graveyard.\n- **test_paradigm_first_resolution_registers_delayed_trigger**: After first resolution, a delayed trigger should be registered for precombat main phases.\n- **test_paradigm_second_resolution_does_not_double_register**: \"After you first resolve\" means the trigger is registered only once, not on each resolution.\n\n### TestImprovisationCapstoneExileFromTop (2 tests)\nVerifies that exile operates from the top of the library (not bottom).\n\n- **test_exiles_from_top_not_bottom**: Confirms cards are exiled from the top (last in internal list).\n- **test_partial_threshold_exiles_correct_cards**: With specific MV distribution, verifies only the correct cards are exiled and the rest remain in library.\n\n### TestImprovisationCapstoneManaCostForCMC (1 test)\n- **test_cmc_is_seven**: {5}{R}{R} has CMC 7, verifying the mana cost is set up correctly.\n\n## Edge cases covered\n- Empty library\n- Library exhausted before reaching MV threshold\n- MV-0 cards (don't count toward threshold)\n- MV exceeding threshold on first card\n- Lands among exiled (not castable)\n- Declining to cast exiled spells\n- Multiple free-casts in one resolution\n- Paradigm double-registration prevention\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (out of scope or engine limitations)\n- Paradigm copy-creation and free-cast at precombat main phase: testing the actual triggered copy at the beginning of precombat main phase would require turn advancement and event firing infrastructure that may not be fully wired. The delayed trigger registration is tested instead.\n- Interaction with counterspells on the free-cast spells: outside this card's scope.\n- Interaction with other replacement effects on the Paradigm exile: outside this card's scope.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1162,"cache_read_input_tokens":67917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1162,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sht194HZVm8bwsRXBUH9Tz","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"05136686-0faf-4509-8935-48c3da026208","request_id":"req_011CbUuqMYFnjRt1MzgK35nD","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_120"}
