{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UHFsonECFVqdBpSkQAAGXM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JnQ8RCsDB42su7KAcMe1Kz","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_120 -- Improvisation Capstone\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Exile-from-library mechanic\n- Implemented as a loop that removes cards from the top of the library one at a time, adding each to exile, and accumulating total mana value until the threshold (4) is reached or the library is empty.\n- Cards with MV 0 are exiled but do not contribute to the running total, naturally handled by their CMC being 0.\n\n### Free-cast from exiled cards\n- After exiling, each non-land card among the exiled cards is offered to the player via `choose_yes_no`.\n- If accepted, the card is removed from exile, its `on_resolve` is called, and it is placed in the appropriate zone (battlefield for permanents, graveyard for instants/sorceries).\n- Lands are skipped (they are not spells and cannot be cast).\n- This simplified free-cast approach directly resolves spells rather than going through the full casting pipeline, which is appropriate for a \"cast without paying mana costs\" effect during resolution.\n\n### Paradigm mechanic\n1. **Exile-instead**: Set `_paradigm_exile = True` marker on the card. Added support for this marker in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell` function, following the same pattern as `_dawning_archaic_exile` from sos_1. Also directly moves self from stack to exile if found on the stack during `on_resolve`.\n2. **Delayed trigger**: Registers a `TriggerRegistration` for the precombat main phase. Uses a game-level `_paradigm_registered` set to track which card names have already had their Paradigm trigger registered, preventing double-registration on subsequent resolutions.\n\n### Engine modification\n- Added `_paradigm_exile` flag handling in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell`, parallel to the existing `_dawning_archaic_exile` flag. This is additive-only.\n\n## Conventions Established\n- Paradigm keyword uses `_paradigm_exile` marker attribute (analogous to `_dawning_archaic_exile`).\n- Game-level `_paradigm_registered` set tracks per-card-name paradigm trigger registration to prevent duplicates.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":87,"cache_read_input_tokens":65512,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":87,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":44,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016uMzbR3dvkvT6pTT1GfrUw","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"18178044-14a5-4246-8877-f6feacc0e735","request_id":"req_011CbUv7GjEMEjjfRWYkXj5c","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_120"}
