{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LFjDyJpDVRo6RbUU7S6QiK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation Rationale: sos_120 -- Improvisation Capstone\n2\t\n3\t## Design Decisions\n4\t\n5\t### Exile-from-library mechanic\n6\t- Implemented as a loop that removes cards from the top of the library one at a time, adding each to exile, and accumulating total mana value until the threshold (4) is reached or the library is empty.\n7\t- Cards with MV 0 are exiled but do not contribute to the running total, naturally handled by their CMC being 0.\n8\t\n9\t### Free-cast from exiled cards\n10\t- After exiling, each non-land card among the exiled cards is offered to the player via `choose_yes_no`.\n11\t- If accepted, the card is removed from exile, its `on_resolve` is called, and it is placed in the appropriate zone (battlefield for permanents, graveyard for instants/sorceries).\n12\t- Lands are skipped (they are not spells and cannot be cast).\n13\t- This simplified free-cast approach directly resolves spells rather than going through the full casting pipeline, which is appropriate for a \"cast without paying mana costs\" effect during resolution.\n14\t\n15\t### Paradigm mechanic\n16\t1. **Exile-instead**: Set `_paradigm_exile = True` marker on the card. Added support for this marker in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell` function, following the same pattern as `_dawning_archaic_exile` from sos_1. Also directly moves self from stack to exile if found on the stack during `on_resolve`.\n17\t2. **Delayed trigger**: Registers a `TriggerRegistration` for the precombat main phase. Uses a game-level `_paradigm_registered` set to track which card names have already had their Paradigm trigger registered, preventing double-registration on subsequent resolutions.\n18\t\n19\t### Engine modification\n20\t- Added `_paradigm_exile` flag handling in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell`, parallel to the existing `_dawning_archaic_exile` flag. This is additive-only.\n21\t\n22\t## Conventions Established\n23\t- Paradigm keyword uses `_paradigm_exile` marker attribute (analogous to `_dawning_archaic_exile`).\n24\t- Game-level `_paradigm_registered` set tracks per-card-name paradigm trigger registration to prevent duplicates.\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AdrYPRBDk5FiWYHm9Vqurq","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"de5b2134-89b1-4bd8-a8f6-189e5279ec0f","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:51:09.073Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_120 implementation"}
