{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MTw2qmHgCENLnAioJoG2MK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018x6gXYJrQo2p7fSQe8FcM5","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revision Rationale for sos_120\n\n## Strict Issue 1: Double zone-move conflict (line 120)\n\n**Fix**: Removed the direct `stack_zone.remove(self)` / `exile.add(self)` code (lines 122-132 of the original). Now only the `_paradigm_exile = True` marker flag is set. This is consistent with the `_dawning_archaic_exile` pattern from sos_1 -- the `_resolve_spell` function in `engine/casting.py` checks for this flag and routes the card from stack to exile instead of graveyard.\n\n## Strict Issue 2: Paradigm delayed trigger is a no-op (line 154)\n\n**Fix**: Replaced the `pass` body in `_paradigm_effect` with a real implementation that:\n1. Searches the controller's exile zone for a card named \"Improvisation Capstone\"\n2. If found, asks the controller whether they want to cast a copy (via `choose_yes_no`)\n3. If yes, creates a shallow copy of the exiled card using `copy.copy()`\n4. Sets the copy's controller and owner\n5. Resolves the copy immediately via `copied.on_resolve(g)` (simplified free-cast, same approach as the main effect's free-cast of exiled spells)\n\nThis implements the Paradigm oracle text: \"you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its mana cost at the beginning of each of your first main phases.\"\n\n## Design decisions\n\n- Used `copy.copy()` for creating the spell copy, consistent with `engine/stack.py`'s `copy_spell()` utility which uses the same approach.\n- The paradigm effect uses the simplified free-cast pattern (direct `on_resolve` call) rather than going through the full casting pipeline, consistent with the advisory note in the review acknowledging this as an acceptable simplification.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":155,"cache_read_input_tokens":43318,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":155,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":45,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014vHCnVAnQfkea4yrVkDgBL","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"d3ed6b9f-de62-49dc-88b6-490417ed5667","request_id":"req_011CbUvWCnjkmJ5RqQTakC9t","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_120 per review"}
