{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QKZipCuNa43vFaqtKq8d8f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DGHeyQ6RjDEZwDKgAXqEKP","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 201 — Lorehold, the Historian\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\n\n### TestLoreholdProperties (8 tests)\nValidates static card data matches the spec:\n- `test_is_creature` — instance of Creature\n- `test_name` — \"Lorehold, the Historian\"\n- `test_mana_cost` — {3}{R}{W}\n- `test_power_toughness` — 5/5\n- `test_has_flying` — Keyword.FLYING\n- `test_has_haste` — Keyword.HASTE\n- `test_legendary_supertype` — Supertype.LEGENDARY\n- `test_elder_dragon_subtypes` — subtypes include \"Elder\" and \"Dragon\"\n\n### TestLoreholdMiracleGrant (4 tests)\nValidates the static ability \"Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}\":\n- `test_instant_in_hand_has_miracle` — instants in controller's hand get miracle_cost = {2}\n- `test_sorcery_in_hand_has_miracle` — sorceries in controller's hand get miracle_cost = {2}\n- `test_creature_in_hand_does_not_get_miracle` — creatures should NOT get miracle\n- `test_opponent_instants_do_not_get_miracle` — opponent's instants should NOT get miracle\n\n### TestLoreholdMiracleTrigger (3 tests)\nTests the miracle mechanic trigger behavior when drawing cards:\n- `test_miracle_trigger_on_first_draw_of_instant` — drawing an instant as first card of turn should create a miracle casting opportunity\n- `test_no_miracle_on_second_draw` — second card drawn this turn should NOT trigger miracle\n- `test_miracle_not_triggered_for_creature_draw` — drawing a creature should not trigger miracle\n\n### TestLoreholdUpkeepTrigger (7 tests)\nTests the triggered ability \"At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\":\n- `test_registers_upkeep_trigger` — at least one trigger is registered\n- `test_trigger_fires_on_opponent_upkeep` — fires when the active player is an opponent\n- `test_trigger_does_not_fire_on_own_upkeep` — does NOT fire on controller's own upkeep\n- `test_upkeep_discard_then_draw` — choosing yes discards a card and draws one\n- `test_upkeep_decline_discard` — choosing no leaves hand and library unchanged\n- `test_upkeep_no_cards_in_hand_no_discard` — empty hand means no discard and no draw\n- `test_upkeep_trigger_source_is_lorehold` — trigger source is the Lorehold card\n- `test_upkeep_trigger_controller_is_lorehold_controller` — trigger controller is p1\n\n### TestLoreholdBattlefield (2 tests)\nETB/LTB lifecycle tests:\n- `test_enters_battlefield_registers_triggers` — triggers register on ETB\n- `test_leaves_battlefield_unregisters_triggers` — triggers unregister on LTB\n\n## Edge cases covered\n- Miracle restricted to instants/sorceries only (creatures excluded)\n- Miracle restricted to controller's hand only (opponent excluded)\n- Miracle only on first card drawn per turn (second draw excluded)\n- Upkeep trigger only on opponent's upkeep (own upkeep excluded)\n- Declining the may ability (no discard, no draw)\n- Empty hand edge case (cannot discard, so no draw)\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (out of scope or engine limitations)\n- Full miracle casting pipeline (casting the revealed card for {2}): depends on implementer's miracle engine additions. The tests check for the presence of miracle attributes and trigger firing rather than a full cast-for-miracle-cost workflow.\n- Multiple Lorehold on the battlefield (legendary rule would destroy one; not specific to this card).\n- Interaction with other miracle cards (if the card already had miracle natively).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6461,"cache_read_input_tokens":59891,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6461,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019SttMsYc5cnXTAV8vKVCFj","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"6d71f84e-d7c2-41ea-820b-d1a47e1b502f","request_id":"req_011CbUvoUEthFQSgcRBx4XU2","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_201"}
