{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SF6kunBMswW2qwsNfu9oJS","type":"tool_result","content":"5105-\n5106-702.152b If a spell has multiple instances of blitz, only one may be used to cast that spell. If a permanent has multiple instances of blitz, each one refers only to payments made for that blitz ability as the spell was cast, not to any payments made for other instances of blitz.\n5107-\n5108:702.153. Casualty\n5109-\n5110:[Omitted long matching line]\n5111-\n5112:702.153b If a spell has multiple instances of casualty, each is paid separately and triggers based on the payments made for it, not any other instance of casualty.\n5113-\n5114-702.154. Enlist\n5115-\n--\n7338-An obsolete term for mana cost. Cards printed with this text have received errata in the Oracle card reference.\n7339-\n7340-Casualty\n7341:A keyword ability that allows you to sacrifice a creature to create a copy of a spell. See 702.153, “Casualty.”\n7342-\n7343-Champion, Championed\n7344-“Champion” is a keyword ability that lets one creature temporarily replace another. A permanent is “championed” by another permanent if the latter exiles the former as the direct result of a champion ability. See rule 702.72, “Champion.”"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LSwiN9oWp7CG9ixhukbp27","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"b4fb8bf7-c5ec-46d0-979a-c7a02eefa950","timestamp":"2026-05-28T12:05:29.558Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_226"}
