{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a6f13bb385c17bd52","tool_use_id":"toolu_01BR2UP9tdVW1CTKcxECQaLo","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/impl-revised-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Implementer","usage":{"total_tokens":33840,"tool_uses":15,"duration_ms":86574},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"c906aa85-b91b-4a70-b35e-dd234d637e98","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NK8iaAfAmeqMMSY1rDnweX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PBgZNphHripmw87mCc9MrH","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revision Rationale for sos_226\n\n## Strict Issue Fixed\n\n**Problem**: The `_casualty_effect` closure searched the stack top-to-bottom for the first instant/sorcery by the controller. If multiple spells by the same controller were on the stack simultaneously, it could match the wrong spell.\n\n**Fix**: Introduced a shared `_pending_spells` list between the condition and effect closures. When `_casualty_condition` matches a spell, it appends the spell reference from `event.spell` to the list. When `_casualty_effect` resolves, it pops the first entry from the list (FIFO order, matching the order conditions are evaluated). The effect then searches the stack only for the exact spell object (identity check via `is`), ensuring it always operates on the correct spell even with multiple instants/sorceries on the stack.\n\n## Advisory Issue Addressed\n\nRemoved unused imports (`StackObject` from `engine.stack` and `Zone` from `engine.types`).\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n- Used a list as a FIFO queue rather than a single mutable variable to correctly handle the case where multiple conditions match before any effects resolve.\n- The effect still searches the stack for the matching `StackObject` by identity (`stack_obj.source is spell`), but now it searches for the specific captured spell rather than any matching spell type.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":141,"cache_read_input_tokens":33601,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":141,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":45,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BR2UP9tdVW1CTKcxECQaLo","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"ce22aec2-8ab2-4bbf-981a-ed6136a194d8","request_id":"req_011CbUx2x6BaC8ePj6mEsRWh","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_226 per review"}
