{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013yohVr34L9X9GyiAtEb4B5","type":"tool_result","content":"4302-702.40b If a spell has multiple instances of storm, each triggers separately.\n4303-\n4304:702.41. Affinity\n4305-\n4306:702.41a Affinity is a static ability that functions while the spell with affinity is on the stack. “Affinity for [text]” means “This spell costs {1} less to cast for each [text] you control.”\n4307-\n4308:702.41b If a spell has multiple instances of affinity, each of them applies.\n4309-\n4310-702.42. Entwine\n--\n7095-Cards with a two-part card frame (one part of which is inset on the left) on a single card where the alternative characteristics include the Adventure spell type. See rule 715, “Adventurer Cards.”\n7096-\n7097:Affinity\n7098:A keyword ability that reduces how much mana you need to spend to cast a spell. See rule 702.41, “Affinity.”\n7099-\n7100-Afflict"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ECf9bUEWLU7PNK51Pzvwdr","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"12651e46-cc44-49f3-8dc2-e273e8ff3202","timestamp":"2026-05-28T12:17:41.998Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_245"}
