{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01US9nAtYBprhU73eyiXod5s","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/continuous_effects.py:39:class SubLayer(enum.Enum):\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-40-    \"\"\"Sub-layers for layer 7 (power/toughness) effects.\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-41-\nengine/continuous_effects.py-42-    Per rule 613.4:\nengine/continuous_effects.py-43-      - 7a: Characteristic-defining abilities that set P/T.\nengine/continuous_effects.py-44-      - 7b: Effects that set P/T to specific values.\nengine/continuous_effects.py-45-      - 7c: Effects that modify P/T (e.g. +2/+2).\nengine/continuous_effects.py-46-      - 7d: P/T changes from counters.\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-47-    \"\"\"\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-48-\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-49-    CHARACTERISTIC_DEFINING = \"7a\"\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-50-    SET_PT = \"7b\"\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-51-    MODIFY_PT = \"7c\"\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-52-    COUNTERS = \"7d\"\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-53-\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-54-"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ECf9bUEWLU7PNK51Pzvwdr","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"cda2a3da-2548-456c-a601-4dd3e6b0fd55","timestamp":"2026-05-28T12:18:26.361Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_245"}
