{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01U34FiTnYbQhpEhTryXk16R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Dyz4U9v6tYfh75hUoZMFU7","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 245 -- Witherbloom, the Balancer\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py\n\n### TestWitherbloomProperties (14 tests)\nValidates all static card properties against the spec:\n- **test_is_creature**: Verifies the card is a Creature subclass\n- **test_name**: Card name matches \"Witherbloom, the Balancer\"\n- **test_mana_cost**: Full mana cost matches {6}{B}{G}\n- **test_mana_cost_generic_is_6**: Generic portion is 6\n- **test_mana_cost_has_black_pip**: One black pip\n- **test_mana_cost_has_green_pip**: One green pip\n- **test_power**: Base power is 5\n- **test_toughness**: Base toughness is 5\n- **test_has_flying**: Flying keyword present\n- **test_has_deathtouch**: Deathtouch keyword present\n- **test_is_legendary**: Legendary supertype present\n- **test_has_creature_type**: CREATURE card type present\n- **test_subtype_elder**: \"Elder\" subtype present\n- **test_subtype_dragon**: \"Dragon\" subtype present\n\n### TestWitherbloomSelfAffinity (9 tests)\nValidates the card's own affinity for creatures mechanic (cost_reduction hook):\n- **test_no_creatures_no_reduction**: Empty battlefield yields 0 reduction\n- **test_one_creature_reduces_by_one**: Single creature yields 1 reduction\n- **test_three_creatures_reduces_by_three**: Three creatures yield 3 reduction\n- **test_six_creatures_reduces_full_generic**: Six creatures reduce the full generic cost\n- **test_more_creatures_than_generic_returns_raw_count**: Per KEY_DECISIONS, raw count is returned (engine clamps)\n- **test_opponent_creatures_do_not_count**: Only \"you control\" creatures count\n- **test_non_creature_permanents_do_not_count**: Enchantments etc. are excluded\n- **test_mixed_permanents_only_count_creatures**: Only creatures in a mixed board count\n- **test_engine_clamps_reduction_to_generic**: get_cost_reduction clamps at 6 (the generic portion)\n\n### TestWitherbloomGrantsAffinity (8 tests)\nValidates the ability \"Instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures\":\n- **test_instant_gets_cost_reduction_from_witherbloom**: Instant gets reduction = creature count\n- **test_sorcery_gets_cost_reduction_from_witherbloom**: Sorcery gets reduction = creature count\n- **test_instant_with_no_creatures_no_reduction**: Witherbloom itself is a creature, so minimum 1\n- **test_sorcery_with_multiple_creatures**: Multiple creatures increase the reduction\n- **test_creature_spell_does_not_get_affinity_grant**: Creature spells are NOT granted affinity\n- **test_enchantment_does_not_get_affinity_grant**: Enchantments are NOT granted affinity\n- **test_opponent_instant_does_not_get_affinity**: Opponent's spells do not benefit\n- **test_instant_cast_with_affinity_uses_reduced_cost**: Integration test -- casting with reduced mana succeeds\n\n### TestWitherbloomGrantsAffinityEdgeCases (2 tests)\nEdge cases for the affinity-granting ability:\n- **test_witherbloom_not_on_battlefield_no_affinity_grant**: Witherbloom in hand/graveyard does not grant affinity\n- **test_witherbloom_counts_itself_as_creature**: Witherbloom is a creature and counts for its own granting\n\n## Edge cases covered\n- Empty battlefield (no creatures)\n- Opponent's creatures vs. your creatures\n- Non-creature permanents mixed in\n- Raw count exceeding generic mana cost (per KEY_DECISIONS convention)\n- Affinity only granted to instants/sorceries, not creatures or enchantments\n- Witherbloom must be on the battlefield for the granting ability to work\n- Witherbloom counts itself as a creature for affinity calculations\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (out of scope)\n- Multiple Witherbloom instances (legendary rule would apply -- engine handles this)\n- Witherbloom leaving the battlefield mid-cast (timing interaction beyond card scope)\n- Interaction with other cost reduction sources (engine-level interaction)\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5591,"cache_read_input_tokens":63975,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5591,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ECf9bUEWLU7PNK51Pzvwdr","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"4a77783b-434d-4a8f-b742-54b1263a3608","request_id":"req_011CbUxNTG9JmEEFihYcMP4D","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_245"}
