{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a3c212bc8f1eb42f6","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cpu7m9TYeeqcwsVuhYLt6R","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Implementer","usage":{"total_tokens":66996,"tool_uses":30,"duration_ms":167638},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"1ea32421-b2fb-49a0-bc26-67dea662f9a4","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PcAVJLj6uC3p7motdD4NFf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LY5hFHYXdtgMtvwv1dn6cS","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_245 -- Witherbloom, the Balancer\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Game-level cost reduction grants\nThe core challenge is that Witherbloom grants affinity for creatures to instants and sorceries its controller casts. The tests call `bolt.cost_reduction(game)` on plain `Instant` objects (not custom subclasses), so the base `CardImpl.cost_reduction` must be able to return non-zero values when external grants exist.\n\nI added a `_cost_reduction_grants` list on `GameState` that holds callables `(game, card) -> int`. The base `CardImpl.cost_reduction` aggregates these grants. This is additive to both the game state and the card base class -- no existing behavior changes.\n\n### Self affinity\nWitherbloom overrides `cost_reduction` directly to count creatures the controller controls. This follows the established sos_1 pattern from KEY_DECISIONS: `cost_reduction(game)` returns the raw count, the engine's `get_cost_reduction()` handles clamping.\n\n### Grant registration\nWhen `register_triggers` is called (upon entering battlefield), Witherbloom registers a grant function that:\n1. Only applies to instants and sorceries\n2. Only applies to spells controlled by Witherbloom's controller\n3. Returns the count of creatures that controller controls\n\n### Engine changes\n- `engine/game_state.py`: Added `_cost_reduction_grants` list attribute (empty by default, no regression impact)\n- `engine/card.py`: Modified `CardImpl.cost_reduction` to aggregate external grants. Returns 0 when no grants exist (preserving default behavior). Subclasses that override `cost_reduction` without calling `super()` are unaffected.\n\n## Conventions Established\n- External cost reduction (affinity grants, \"spells you cast cost less\") should use `game._cost_reduction_grants` list of `(game, card) -> int` callables.\n- Cards that grant cost reduction register their grant in `register_triggers` and store a reference for later unregistration.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":106,"cache_read_input_tokens":66668,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":106,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":44,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cpu7m9TYeeqcwsVuhYLt6R","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"8879a4e3-9650-4f22-980c-40d31684bdf8","request_id":"req_011CbUxgfeXgFXM7RanRkqvK","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_245"}
