{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BjVGnXk3rtZxbTrJk9fpHv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Rationale for SOS 245 -- Witherbloom, the Balancer\n2\t\n3\t## File: cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py\n4\t\n5\t### TestWitherbloomProperties (14 tests)\n6\tValidates all static card properties against the spec:\n7\t- **test_is_creature**: Verifies the card is a Creature subclass\n8\t- **test_name**: Card name matches \"Witherbloom, the Balancer\"\n9\t- **test_mana_cost**: Full mana cost matches {6}{B}{G}\n10\t- **test_mana_cost_generic_is_6**: Generic portion is 6\n11\t- **test_mana_cost_has_black_pip**: One black pip\n12\t- **test_mana_cost_has_green_pip**: One green pip\n13\t- **test_power**: Base power is 5\n14\t- **test_toughness**: Base toughness is 5\n15\t- **test_has_flying**: Flying keyword present\n16\t- **test_has_deathtouch**: Deathtouch keyword present\n17\t- **test_is_legendary**: Legendary supertype present\n18\t- **test_has_creature_type**: CREATURE card type present\n19\t- **test_subtype_elder**: \"Elder\" subtype present\n20\t- **test_subtype_dragon**: \"Dragon\" subtype present\n21\t\n22\t### TestWitherbloomSelfAffinity (9 tests)\n23\tValidates the card's own affinity for creatures mechanic (cost_reduction hook):\n24\t- **test_no_creatures_no_reduction**: Empty battlefield yields 0 reduction\n25\t- **test_one_creature_reduces_by_one**: Single creature yields 1 reduction\n26\t- **test_three_creatures_reduces_by_three**: Three creatures yield 3 reduction\n27\t- **test_six_creatures_reduces_full_generic**: Six creatures reduce the full generic cost\n28\t- **test_more_creatures_than_generic_returns_raw_count**: Per KEY_DECISIONS, raw count is returned (engine clamps)\n29\t- **test_opponent_creatures_do_not_count**: Only \"you control\" creatures count\n30\t- **test_non_creature_permanents_do_not_count**: Enchantments etc. are excluded\n31\t- **test_mixed_permanents_only_count_creatures**: Only creatures in a mixed board count\n32\t- **test_engine_clamps_reduction_to_generic**: get_cost_reduction clamps at 6 (the generic portion)\n33\t\n34\t### TestWitherbloomGrantsAffinity (8 tests)\n35\tValidates the ability \"Instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures\":\n36\t- **test_instant_gets_cost_reduction_from_witherbloom**: Instant gets reduction = creature count\n37\t- **test_sorcery_gets_cost_reduction_from_witherbloom**: Sorcery gets reduction = creature count\n38\t- **test_instant_with_no_creatures_no_reduction**: Witherbloom itself is a creature, so minimum 1\n39\t- **test_sorcery_with_multiple_creatures**: Multiple creatures increase the reduction\n40\t- **test_creature_spell_does_not_get_affinity_grant**: Creature spells are NOT granted affinity\n41\t- **test_enchantment_does_not_get_affinity_grant**: Enchantments are NOT granted affinity\n42\t- **test_opponent_instant_does_not_get_affinity**: Opponent's spells do not benefit\n43\t- **test_instant_cast_with_affinity_uses_reduced_cost**: Integration test -- casting with reduced mana succeeds\n44\t\n45\t### TestWitherbloomGrantsAffinityEdgeCases (2 tests)\n46\tEdge cases for the affinity-granting ability:\n47\t- **test_witherbloom_not_on_battlefield_no_affinity_grant**: Witherbloom in hand/graveyard does not grant affinity\n48\t- **test_witherbloom_counts_itself_as_creature**: Witherbloom is a creature and counts for its own granting\n49\t\n50\t## Edge cases covered\n51\t- Empty battlefield (no creatures)\n52\t- Opponent's creatures vs. your creatures\n53\t- Non-creature permanents mixed in\n54\t- Raw count exceeding generic mana cost (per KEY_DECISIONS convention)\n55\t- Affinity only granted to instants/sorceries, not creatures or enchantments\n56\t- Witherbloom must be on the battlefield for the granting ability to work\n57\t- Witherbloom counts itself as a creature for affinity calculations\n58\t\n59\t## Edge cases NOT covered (out of scope)\n60\t- Multiple Witherbloom instances (legendary rule would apply -- engine handles this)\n61\t- Witherbloom leaving the battlefield mid-cast (timing interaction beyond card scope)\n62\t- Interaction with other cost reduction sources (engine-level interaction)\n63\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cpu7m9TYeeqcwsVuhYLt6R","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"56cd7188-9d8f-44d4-ab65-b9522382a2c0","timestamp":"2026-05-28T12:24:17.600Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_245"}
