{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E73bvvjB72sPAu3LSdTEs3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation Rationale: sos_245 -- Witherbloom, the Balancer\n2\t\n3\t## Design Decisions\n4\t\n5\t### Game-level cost reduction grants\n6\tThe core challenge is that Witherbloom grants affinity for creatures to instants and sorceries its controller casts. The tests call `bolt.cost_reduction(game)` on plain `Instant` objects (not custom subclasses), so the base `CardImpl.cost_reduction` must be able to return non-zero values when external grants exist.\n7\t\n8\tI added a `_cost_reduction_grants` list on `GameState` that holds callables `(game, card) -> int`. The base `CardImpl.cost_reduction` aggregates these grants. This is additive to both the game state and the card base class -- no existing behavior changes.\n9\t\n10\t### Self affinity\n11\tWitherbloom overrides `cost_reduction` directly to count creatures the controller controls. This follows the established sos_1 pattern from KEY_DECISIONS: `cost_reduction(game)` returns the raw count, the engine's `get_cost_reduction()` handles clamping.\n12\t\n13\t### Grant registration\n14\tWhen `register_triggers` is called (upon entering battlefield), Witherbloom registers a grant function that:\n15\t1. Only applies to instants and sorceries\n16\t2. Only applies to spells controlled by Witherbloom's controller\n17\t3. Returns the count of creatures that controller controls\n18\t\n19\t### Engine changes\n20\t- `engine/game_state.py`: Added `_cost_reduction_grants` list attribute (empty by default, no regression impact)\n21\t- `engine/card.py`: Modified `CardImpl.cost_reduction` to aggregate external grants. Returns 0 when no grants exist (preserving default behavior). Subclasses that override `cost_reduction` without calling `super()` are unaffected.\n22\t\n23\t## Conventions Established\n24\t- External cost reduction (affinity grants, \"spells you cast cost less\") should use `game._cost_reduction_grants` list of `(game, card) -> int` callables.\n25\t- Cards that grant cost reduction register their grant in `register_triggers` and store a reference for later unregistration.\n26\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013QMfyNeNrzXeXfbK67fwMN","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"dbe9467d-7ed9-448b-8bdf-925e8dca04e6","timestamp":"2026-05-28T12:24:58.708Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_245 implementation"}
