{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CTbx3Yh4gPx9NBCL1hnMFw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Key Decisions\n2\t\n3\tPersistent decision log across all runs.\n4\t\n5\t## sos_1: Exile replacement via marker flag\n6\t- For cards that exile spells cast from graveyard (\"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"), a `_<source>_exile` marker attribute on the card is checked in `engine/casting.py`'s `_resolve_spell()`.\n7\t- This avoids deeper engine restructuring (the ReplacementManager handles battlefield-leaving replacements, not stack-to-graveyard).\n8\t\n9\t## sos_1: Cost reduction pattern\n10\t- `cost_reduction(game)` returns the raw count (unclamped). The engine's `get_cost_reduction()` handles clamping at generic cost.\n11\t\n12\t## sos_4: Converge mechanic pattern\n13\t- Converge cards use a `colors_spent` list attribute on the card object. X = `len(set(colors_spent))` for distinct colors.\n14\t- The casting system or tests set `colors_spent` directly on the card.\n15\t\n16\t## sos_13: Prepared designation pattern\n17\t- Cards with \"prepare\" use `is_prepared` attribute on the creature.\n18\t- The `resolve_prepare_spell(game, target)` method pattern implements the prepare spell effect.\n19\t- Record creature stats (power, controller) before zone moves to ensure consistency.\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017wkcqnh46eUD9KHzuk3jLZ","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"0492f1a9-b936-4d01-b2e6-fb1d68993247","timestamp":"2026-05-28T12:32:16.650Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RayrWWEEZD4y71TW735WpV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"cards\": [\n3\t    {\n4\t      \"card\": \"sos_1\",\n5\t      \"tests\": [\n6\t        {\n7\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py\",\n8\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for The Dawning Archaic: static properties, cost reduction by graveyard instant/sorcery count, attack trigger casting from graveyard, exile replacement effect\"\n9\t        }\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"implementation\": [\n12\t        {\n13\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py\",\n14\t          \"summary\": \"TheDawningArchaic creature with cost reduction, attack trigger for free-casting instants/sorceries from graveyard, and exile-instead marker\"\n15\t        },\n16\t        {\n17\t          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n18\t          \"summary\": \"Added exile-instead check in _resolve_spell for cards marked with _dawning_archaic_exile flag\"\n19\t        }\n20\t      ]\n21\t    },\n22\t    {\n23\t      \"card\": \"sos_120\",\n24\t      \"tests\": [\n25\t        {\n26\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py\",\n27\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for Improvisation Capstone: static properties, exile-from-library until MV>=4, free-cast from exiled, Paradigm exile-instead and delayed trigger registration\"\n28\t        }\n29\t      ],\n30\t      \"implementation\": [\n31\t        {\n32\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py\",\n33\t          \"summary\": \"ImprovisationCapstone sorcery with exile-from-library, free-cast, Paradigm exile marker flag, and delayed trigger with copy-from-exile effect\"\n34\t        }\n35\t      ]\n36\t    },\n37\t    {\n38\t      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n39\t      \"tests\": [\n40\t        {\n41\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n42\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for Emeritus of Truce: static properties, ETB trigger, Inkling token creation, prepared condition, targeting, cast integration, and Swords to Plowshares prepare spell effect (exile creature, life gain, unprepare)\"\n43\t        }\n44\t      ],\n45\t      \"implementation\": [\n46\t        {\n47\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n48\t          \"summary\": \"EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares with ETB Inkling token, prepared designation, and resolve_prepare_spell for Swords to Plowshares exile + life gain effect\"\n49\t        }\n50\t      ]\n51\t    },\n52\t    {\n53\t      \"card\": \"sos_201\",\n54\t      \"tests\": [\n55\t        {\n56\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\",\n57\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for Lorehold the Historian: static properties, miracle granting to instants/sorceries in hand, miracle trigger on first draw, upkeep looting trigger on opponent upkeep, ETB/LTB trigger registration\"\n58\t        }\n59\t      ],\n60\t      \"implementation\": [\n61\t        {\n62\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py\",\n63\t          \"summary\": \"LoreholdTheHistorian creature with Flying/Haste, miracle {2} granting to instants/sorceries in hand, miracle draw trigger, and opponent upkeep discard-to-draw looting trigger\"\n64\t        }\n65\t      ]\n66\t    },\n67\t    {\n68\t      \"card\": \"sos_226\",\n69\t      \"tests\": [\n70\t        {\n71\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py\",\n72\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for Silverquill the Disputant: static properties, casualty 1 trigger registration, condition filtering for instants/sorceries by controller, casualty payment creates copy on stack, no-copy when unpaid, power threshold validation, sacrifice moves to graveyard, trigger unregistration on leave\"\n73\t        }\n74\t      ],\n75\t      \"implementation\": [\n76\t        {\n77\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\",\n78\t          \"summary\": \"SilverquillTheDisputant creature with Flying/Vigilance, casualty 1 granting via captured spell reference in condition/effect closure pair, copy_spell on casualty payment, can_pay_casualty validation\"\n79\t        }\n80\t      ]\n81\t    },\n82\t    {\n83\t      \"card\": \"sos_245\",\n84\t      \"tests\": [\n85\t        {\n86\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py\",\n87\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for Witherbloom the Balancer: static properties, self affinity for creatures cost reduction, grants affinity to instant/sorcery spells, edge cases for granting\"\n88\t        }\n89\t      ],\n90\t      \"implementation\": [\n91\t        {\n92\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py\",\n93\t          \"summary\": \"WitherbloomTheBalancer creature with affinity for creatures and affinity granting to instants/sorceries via game-level cost reduction grants\"\n94\t        },\n95\t        {\n96\t          \"path\": \"engine/card.py\",\n97\t          \"summary\": \"Modified CardImpl.cost_reduction to aggregate external cost reduction grants from game._cost_reduction_grants\"\n98\t        },\n99\t        {\n100\t          \"path\": \"engine/game_state.py\",\n101\t          \"summary\": \"Added _cost_reduction_grants list for external cost reduction grant registration\"\n102\t        }\n103\t      ]\n104\t    },\n105\t    {\n106\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n107\t      \"tests\": [\n108\t        {\n109\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n110\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for Together as One: static properties, dual targeting, converge X=0/1/3/5 for draw/damage/life, edge cases (creature damage, opponent draw, controller life gain, no-targets safety)\"\n111\t        }\n112\t      ],\n113\t      \"implementation\": [\n114\t        {\n115\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n116\t          \"summary\": \"TogetherAsOne sorcery with converge: target player draws X, deals X damage to any target, controller gains X life where X = distinct colors spent\"\n117\t        }\n118\t      ]\n119\t    },\n120\t    {\n121\t      \"card\": \"sos_57\",