{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018jEMmb4FdF3CDrDtVqUwkM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012FuQHhdUxPYCogJY67WJG9","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Land subclass with dynamic creature properties\n- Extends `Land` (not `Creature`) since it starts as a land. When animated, `CardType.CREATURE` is added to `card_types` and `power`/`toughness` are exposed via properties.\n- Used `@property` for `power`, `toughness`, `base_power`, `base_toughness` that return values only when `_is_animated` is True, matching the test expectations that check both property names.\n\n### Mana abilities with closure-based cost functions\n- Cost functions use single-arg `(game)` signature with the card captured via closure (`source = self`). This matches how tests call `ability.cost(game)` directly without needing the two-arg fallback.\n- Follows the `fdn_267` Secluded Courtyard pattern but simplified to single-arg closures.\n\n### Any-color mana ability with life payment\n- The tap + pay 1 life cost is handled atomically in the cost function: checks not tapped, checks life >= 1, then taps and deducts life.\n- ENGINE LIMITATION: Spending restriction (\"only to cast instant or sorcery\") is not enforced per engine limitations, same as Secluded Courtyard's approach.\n\n### Animation via activated ability\n- The `{5}` cost uses `ManaCost(generic=5)` with `can_pay`/`pay` on the controller's mana pool.\n- The effect checks \"if this land isn't a creature\" before animating, matching the card's conditional.\n- On animation, adds `CardType.CREATURE` and `\"Wizard\"` subtype, sets `_is_animated = True`.\n\n### Triggered ability registration on animation\n- A `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger is registered when the land is animated.\n- Condition checks: controller matches, and spell has INSTANT or SORCERY card type.\n- Effect increments `_power_bonus` which is added to the base power of 2 in the `power` property.\n- Pump stacks across multiple casts as tested by `test_multiple_instants_stack_pump`.\n\n## Deviations\n- None. Implementation follows card spec directly.\n\n## Conventions\n- For lands that animate into creatures, use `@property` for power/toughness instead of inheriting from Creature, since the card starts as a non-creature permanent.\n- Capture `self` as `source` in closures for mana/activated ability callbacks.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":106,"cache_read_input_tokens":58334,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":106,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":44,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017wkcqnh46eUD9KHzuk3jLZ","session_id":"61c1c383-66ff-4b43-bc55-e6e3182b632f","uuid":"4ec8fe4e-b1a2-40d0-b80c-79a71ad30501","request_id":"req_011CbUySFFJv5Vd6izFap53e","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
