{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0191Jk1zHjumqH9525Uv4AFE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Nfa1k1jZWBdGqMH5oBDtQt","name":"Agent","input":{"subagent_type":"Implementer","description":"Revise sos_257 per review","prompt":"You are the Implementer agent. Revise the sos_257 implementation based on reviewer feedback.\n\n## Card\n- Card ID: sos_257\n- Implementation: cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py\n- Tests: cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py (DO NOT MODIFY)\n- Review: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json\n\n## Strict issue to fix\nThe pump effect (+1/+0) increments _power_bonus permanently, but the oracle text says \"+1/+0 until end of turn\". The bonus should reset at end of turn. Options:\n- Use ContinuousEffect with DURATION_END_OF_TURN\n- Or use another mechanism that resets at end of turn\n\nImportant: the tests must still pass. Read the tests to see how they verify the pump effect — they may be checking _power_bonus directly, in which case you need to ensure compatibility.\n\n## Instructions\n1. Read the review.json and the test file to understand expectations.\n2. Fix the strict issue while keeping all tests passing.\n3. Do NOT modify test files.\n4. Verify: `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py -x -v`\n5. Verify no regressions: `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -x -q && python3 -m pytest cards/fdn/ -x -q`\n\n## Output\n- Write revised diff: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\n- Write rationale: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised-rationale.md\n- Write disagreements: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json\n- Update FILES_MODIFIED.json\n\nReturn: REVISION_DONE with disagreement_count."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":484,"cache_read_input_tokens":61265,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":484},"output_toke